sed for jackets and shoes.","id":"da8712d351af","source":"BTS 27 · #60","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/34e099f0-94aa-44b9-837b-6fd54c4b3412.webp","imageBytes":19608},"82b47214d5e9":{"text":"Bright colors make bold fashion statements.","id":"82b47214d5e9","source":"BTS 27 · #52","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/a49b3641-1423-457f-92ab-eb4f88bc9b8f.webp","imageBytes":15784},"f01cd27baf64":{"text":"Fabrics have different textures and feels.","id":"f01cd27baf64","source":"BTS 27 · #64","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/03214de7-8bae-479e-a681-05de03b29f8c.webp","imageBytes":19376},"ad748ccf58e0":{"text":"Cotton clothes can be casual and cheap or fancy and expensive.","id":"ad748ccf58e0","source":"BTS 27 · #4","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/03db98d8-cdf5-4190-9572-de083e392537.webp","imageBytes":15462},"ec3c2a5bfac2":{"text":"The sweater she wears is made of wool.","id":"ec3c2a5bfac2","source":"BTS 27 · #6","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/6131440c-2a87-4905-be52-65206490543a.webp","imageBytes":44102,"video":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/dbcc006e-134d-4e0e-b304-b34c53938740.mp4","videoBytes":445243,"duration":5.875},"76d9abc89d64":{"text":"Sometimes I don't need to look fashionable.","id":"76d9abc89d64","source":"BTS 27 · #7"},"39f0c24cd09d":{"text":"I have a few new sweaters and skirts that I think are very fashionable.","id":"39f0c24cd09d","source":"BTS 27 · #9","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/c5eb7d03-99cb-402d-9f2a-257c00242207.webp","imageBytes":10638},"9ffba2c2ad51":{"text":"When I go to English class, I want to look nice.","id":"9ffba2c2ad51","source":"BTS 27 · #8"},"df5b45a8fe24":{"text":"My friends said that my new skirt was pretty and I felt very happy.","id":"df5b45a8fe24","source":"BTS 27 · #10","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/31506002-c3db-460a-8113-0947f1bc1c1c.webp","imageBytes":15850},"e185b32e6f4d":{"text":"Patterns like stripes and plaid are popular in fashion.","id":"e185b32e6f4d","source":"BTS 27 · #53","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/a618a8e8-e35d-462a-bc7c-9c5e4e1b90ab.webp","imageBytes":22846},"b0f416536665":{"text":"Fashion should make you feel confident.","id":"b0f416536665","source":"BTS 27 · #80","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/8d38c4ea-7795-49a5-a366-1ad613071242.webp","imageBytes":14414},"b217c644f4d0":{"text":"Mixing classic and trendy pieces creates good style.","id":"b217c644f4d0","source":"BTS 27 · #83","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/a203ca87-3377-47ff-a4cf-4ed008eaafbf.webp","imageBytes":18812},"a9187838fdb4":{"text":"My mom says that money can't always buy happiness.","id":"a9187838fdb4","source":"BTS 27 · #12","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/7bd3f7d1-a7ef-4717-b303-1ea3031ad9df.webp","imageBytes":28396},"a258a2fbb0ec":{"text":"I think she's right.","id":"a258a2fbb0ec","source":"BTS 27 · #13","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/29505e03-2a2c-4311-a0dd-491343174862.webp","imageBytes":12072},"26d5e896294d":{"text":"Polka dots have been popular for about one hundred years.","id":"26d5e896294d","source":"BTS 27 · #14","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/873beaff-c2ab-41ed-b698-49e2bf516624.webp","imageBytes":32360},"979385376527":{"text":"Young people often follow fashion influencers online.","id":"979385376527","source":"BTS 27 · #28","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/c10ed761-e863-4e38-8e4a-ca3639c9ef62.webp",